From: uke bring-up <uke@local>
Subject: [PATCH] uke: log the GPU addon staging result

The addon staging's counters are already kept (zzy-native-gpu-addon-mount);
this restores the one-line result log the working addon images carried
(check-gpu-addon-host.py requires it as evidence that staging ran).

---
 bsd/kern/kern_exec.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

--- a/bsd/kern/kern_exec.c
+++ b/bsd/kern/kern_exec.c
@@ -7483,6 +7483,8 @@ native_gpu_addon_install(proc_t p, user_addr_t scratch)
 		}
 		at += (packed + 7) & ~7ULL;
 	}
+	printf("UKE GPU addon: stage=%d files=%d bytes=%llu error=%d\n", native_gpu_addon_stage,
+	    native_gpu_addon_files, (unsigned long long)native_gpu_addon_written, native_gpu_addon_error);
 }
 /* The OS cryptex where iPadOS looks for it. The root volume's entries for cryptex content are links into /System/Cryptexes/OS, which
  * leads to /private/preboot/Cryptexes/OS; WebKit's processes are ExtensionKit extensions reached that way
